   </dc:creator>
   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Green Madagascar Day Gecko (Phelsuma madagascariensis) in the Masoala rainforest hall of Zoo Zurich (Switzerland) on June 15, 2012. Built in 2003 as a small replica of the Madagascar Masoala rainforest, the hall covers an area of more than 10'000 spare meters and is one of Zurich Zoo's main attractions.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
   <dc:subject>
